      "message": "what other context you have in mind?\nImho if LIVE is Supported but not Available we should not use headset for recording.\n\nSame applies to all other context. If given context is in the Supported context it means remote device is aware of such context and if remote what us to use it, then it should be in Available context.\n\nIf remote has UNSPECIFIED in the Available context then we can fallback to that context whenever Context Android wants to use is not in the Supported list.",
